{"info": {"address1": "Birla Aurora", "address2": "Level 21 Plot No. 1080 Dr. Annie Besant Road, Worli", "city": "Mumbai", "zip": "400030", "country": "India", "phone": "91 22 6251 7000", "fax": "91 22 2436 2403", "website": "https://www.siemens.com/in/en.html", "industry": "Specialty Industrial Machinery", "industryKey": "specialty-industrial-machinery", "industryDisp": "Specialty Industrial Machinery", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "Siemens Limited, a technology company, engages in industry, infrastructure, and mobility business in India and internationally. The company operates through Smart Infrastructure, Mobility, Digital Industries, and Portfolio Companies segments. The Smart Infrastructure segment supplies products, systems, solutions, and services for transmission and distribution of electrical energy for power utilities, industrial companies, and infrastructure segments. This segment offers systems for low and medium voltage distribution; solutions for smart grids and energy automation; and low voltage power supply systems, as well as intelligent and connected infrastructure for grids and buildings. The Mobility segment provides solutions for passenger and freight transportation, including rail vehicles, rail automation systems, rail electrification systems, turnkey systems, and related services. The Digital Industries segment offers products for automation and digitalization of discrete, hybrid, and process industries. This segments portfolio consists of industrial software and automation, and drive technology products for optimizing manufacturing value chain, covering product design, production planning, engineering, execution, and customer services. The Portfolio Companies segment supplies products and services of low-voltage motors. The company engages in the lease rental business. It also installs industrial machinery and equipment. The company was formerly known as Siemens India Limited and changed its name to Siemens Limited in March 1987. Siemens Limited was founded in 1867 and is based in Mumbai, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sunil Dass Mathur B.Sc.", "age": 62, "title": "CEO & Managing Director", "yearBorn": 1963, "fiscalYear": 2024, "totalPay": 188560000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Wolfgang  Wrumnig", "age": 60, "title": "CFO & Executive Director", "yearBorn": 1965, "fiscalYear": 2024, "totalPay": 61748040, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ketan Nandkishor Thaker", "title": "Compliance Officer, Company Secretary & Nodal Officer", "fiscalYear": 2024, "totalPay": 15000000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vineet  Rastogi", "title": "Head of Accounting & Controlling", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Radhika  Arora", "title": "Head of Investor Relations", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Dr. Laurenz  Littmann", "title": "General Counsel", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Indu  Sharma", "title": "Head of Corporate Communications", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Sabine  Schneider", "title": "Head of People & Organisation", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Naveen  Mohan", "title": "Executive Vice President of Investor Relations & Supply Chain Management", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Robert Harald Kottukapally Demann", "title": "Head of Smart Infrastructure", "fiscalYear": 2024, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}], "auditRisk": 7, "boardRisk": 9, "compensationRisk": 1, "shareHolderRightsRisk": 8, "overallRisk": 7, "governanceEpochDate